      "role": "user",
      "content": "Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters\n\nGiven a string s, find the length of the longest substring without duplicate characters.\n\nExample: s = 'abcabcbb' -> 3 ('abc'). s = 'bbbbb' -> 1.\nConstraints: 0 <= len(s) <= 5 * 10^4; s consists of English letters, digits, symbols and spaces.",
      "id": "m-1",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-09T18:12:41.528Z",
      "durationMs": 0
    },
